invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/lint-trust-separation.sh
reason: a host object stops carrying chacha20_sve2.c, and on arm64 its
  link fails on chacha20_sve2_xor, which chacha20.c calls there, only
  where something links it. lint-trust-separation's ChaCha20 rows require
  the file in every host object's source list.

--- old
CHACHA_VECTOR_SRCS := src/chacha20_vector.c src/chacha20_sve2.c src/chacha20_avx2.c src/chacha20_avx512.c
--- new
CHACHA_VECTOR_SRCS := src/chacha20_vector.c src/chacha20_avx2.c src/chacha20_avx512.c
